OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786358877
OL,3,CMan who filmed himself causing
OL,4,Cunnecessary suffering to a rabbit has
OL,5,Cbeen jailed
OL,7,FA man from Poole, who filmed himself
OL,8,Fpulling a live rabbit out of a bag at
OL,9,FBroadstone recreation ground, before
OL,10,Fsetting a young dog on it, has been
OL,11,Fjailed.
OL,13,FBilly Banks, 33, uploaded the video
OL,14,Fand posted it onto an open hare
OL,15,Fcoursing group on Facebook.
OL,17,FHe was seen kicking the rabbit several
OL,18,Ftimes to make it run off so the dog
OL,19,Fwould continue pursuing it.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
