PN,38902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786358877
OL,3,CMan who filmed himself causing
OL,4,Cunnecessary suffering to a rabbit has
OL,5,Cbeen jailed
OL,7,FBanks was identified from the footage
OL,8,Fand subsequently arrested by police in
OL,9,FNovember 2025.
OL,11,FHe was charged with causing
OL,12,Funnecessary suffering to a protected
OL,13,Fanimal and pleaded guilty at Poole
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court.
OL,16,FBanks appeared at Bournemouth Crown
OL,17,FCourt on Friday 7 August 2026 and was
OL,18,Fsentenced to six months in prison.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
