PN,38903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786358877
OL,3,CMan who filmed himself causing
OL,4,Cunnecessary suffering to a rabbit has
OL,5,Cbeen jailed
OL,7,FHe was also banned from owning or
OL,8,Fkeeping dogs, rabbits or hares for a
OL,9,Fperiod of ten years.
OL,11,FBanks was further sentenced for
OL,12,Funrelated charges of being concerned
OL,13,Fin the supply of class A drugs and
OL,14,Facquiring, using or possessing
OL,15,Fcriminal property linked to an
OL,16,Finvestigation by officers in Poole
OL,17,Finto offences between August and
OL,18,FNovember 2023.
OL,20,FHe was sentenced to a total of six
OL,21,Fyears and one month in prison.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
