PN,38904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786358877
OL,3,CMan who filmed himself causing
OL,4,Cunnecessary suffering to a rabbit has
OL,5,Cbeen jailed
OL,7,FPolice Constable Chandler Organ, of
OL,8,Fthe Rural Crime Team, said: "Banks
OL,9,Fposted the offence on social media
OL,10,Fhimself, which led to some backlash
OL,11,Ffrom the public and allowed officers
OL,12,Fto take action.
OL,14,FThis type of activity is unacceptable
OL,15,Fand we will continue to investigate
OL,16,Freports of this nature and hold those
OL,17,Fresponsible to account."
